USGSTopo credits: USGS The National Map: National Boundaries Dataset, 3DEP
Elevation Program, Geographic Names Information System, National Hydrography
Dataset, National Land Cover Database, National Structures Dataset, and National
Transportation Dataset; USGS Global Ecosystems; U.S. Census Bureau TIGER/Line
data; USFS Road data; Natural Earth Data; U.S. Department of State HIU; NOAA
National Centers for Environmental Information.
USGSImageryOnly credits: USDA, USGS The National Map: Orthoimagery.
Full provider statements, source dates, tile/export references, and checksums
remain in content/topography.json, content/satellite.json,
content/leg_photo_manifest.json, and their referenced source metadata.
Provider refresh dates are not individual image capture dates. The imagery
provides historical geographic context rather than current trail conditions.

